      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Current literature supports the use of self-management plans in childhood asthma. The aim of this article is to describe the purpose of such plans. It gives step-by-step advice on how to prepare an individualized management plan and discusses important considerations on how they can best be implemented in clinical practice."},
